{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"d4344a40-1c5b-400c-ae8f-fcdc24a5ef97":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"92509ddc-3ec2-4529-b160-6e1da5dc9927":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":"shopify:\/\/pages\/gang"}},"wishlist_engine_product_page_dhB7Kj":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/se-wishlist-engine\/blocks\/Product-Page\/8f7c0857-8e71-463d-a168-8e133094753b","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"bffe66cd-99d4-43eb-acd0-9850f187e77f":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","theme":"light","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"recommended_products_Xhj9TK":{"type":"recommended_products","settings":{"title":"The Perfect Gifting","content":"","button_text":"Add all to cart","product_list":["pornstar-martini-cocktail-bundle","giftbox"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":false,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":false}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>This refreshing liqueur has the sweet aroma and succulent taste of sun ripened peaches. Made using only natural ingredients without any artificial colouring or preservatives. <strong>Real peach juice<\/strong>  is paired with fine citrus notes to create this delicious addition to flavour range, perfect for the summer.<\/p><p>Although only introduced to the O'Donnell range in 2024, Peach has fast become a firm fan favourite and was awarded a silver medal at the Spirit Business Awards 2024.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional Mason Jars, we promise a unique drinking experience. If you would like to discover <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">more high quality liqueurs<\/a>, have a look at our entire product range. Become part of our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and unlock unique benefits.<\/p><p>For those new to Moonshine, it was the name given to illegally produced grain alcohol distilled during the American Prohibition. It was traditionally bottled in Mason Jars to avoid detection by the authorities. O’Donnell Moonshine retains the rebellious nature of that era, while delivering a whole new world of flavour in our range of smooth and delicious liqueurs.<\/p><h5>*Consult our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/faq\">FAQ's<\/a> for more information.<\/h5>","page":""}},"7a118c82-928c-48ad-b111-25c0dc4875e1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Moonshine Must-Haves","icon":"check_mark","content":"<p>1. Your jar of <a href=\"\/collections\/moonshine\" title=\"Moonshine\">Moonshine<\/a>.<\/p><p>2. Our reusable <a href=\"\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"Pouring Lid\">Pouring Lid<\/a> to not waste a drop.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<h3>Peach Spritz<\/h3><h4>Ingredients<\/h4><ul><li>50ml <em>Peach<\/em><\/li><li>100ml Prosecco<\/li><li>Lemonade or Soda Water<\/li><\/ul><h4>Recipe<\/h4><ol><li>Fill a glass with ice and add <em>Peach<\/em>. <\/li><li>Pour in prosecco and top up with lemonade\/soda water (depending on your taste).<\/li><li>Stir and garnish with peach or orange slices.<\/li><li>Serve and enjoy!<\/li><\/ol>","page":""}},"32b786d6-269a-4f91-b1c1-1127d452915e":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"306ee80a-abbf-4074-92bc-03e3130ac128":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products, unless stated otherwise, are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","d4344a40-1c5b-400c-ae8f-fcdc24a5ef97","caption","price","description","variant_picker","quantity_selector","92509ddc-3ec2-4529-b160-6e1da5dc9927","buy_buttons","wishlist_engine_product_page_dhB7Kj","bffe66cd-99d4-43eb-acd0-9850f187e77f","recommended_products_Xhj9TK","collapsible-row-0","7a118c82-928c-48ad-b111-25c0dc4875e1","collapsible-row-1","32b786d6-269a-4f91-b1c1-1127d452915e","306ee80a-abbf-4074-92bc-03e3130ac128","collapsible-row-2"],"settings":{"gift_card_receipient_enabled":false,"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"badges_enabled":false,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"small","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"aad13389-b9cf-4d13-9347-0c02f8f34847":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"0bf122bd-c884-4741-9b57-ac0baae4426c":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Experience the Taste of Summer!","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--17918499782924__aad13389-b9cf-4d13-9347-0c02f8f34847-16818086767e69e669-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>For your perfect Moonshine moment, we recommend mixing simple sparkling drinks mixed with Peach. You can create the sweetest sips, simply using Moonshine and Soda Water! This one also works well neat, on the rocks!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["0bf122bd-c884-4741-9b57-ac0baae4426c","template--17918499782924__aad13389-b9cf-4d13-9347-0c02f8f34847-16818086767e69e669-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Peach_1.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"79a4a449-dc8e-4d3c-84d6-48c90e6c1ba3":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"22f06935-f26e-4ca5-aafe-1f525f5694a4":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Natural Ingredients","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--17918499782924__79a4a449-dc8e-4d3c-84d6-48c90e6c1ba3-16818086767e69e669-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>This flavour is made using real peach juice, with no artificial colouring or preservatives. Enjoy the taste of summer with our Peach Moonshine!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"b